         they only run in the project that directly references the package; the copied
         vcinet\ subfolder is not a tracked output and does not flow from Shim's bin to
         the app's bin. Without this, HardwareCan fails: "Did not find vcinet\x64\vcinet.x64.dll". -->
    <PackageReference Include="Ixxat.Vci4" Version="4.1.4" />
